---

The Software downloads sanctions lists published by third parties. Those lists
are not covered by this licence and remain subject to the terms of the body
that publishes them, which are recorded per source in reference/sources.md and
printed by `python3 screen.py sources`. In summary:

  UK Sanctions List (FCDO)        Open Government Licence v3.0
  OFSI consolidated list          Open Government Licence v3.0
  UN Security Council list        United Nations, free to reproduce
  EU consolidated list            European Commission reuse policy
  OFAC SDN and non-SDN lists      US Government work, public domain
  Canada SEMA / JVCFOA list       Open Government Licence – Canada
  SECO Swiss sanctions list       Swiss Confederation, free reuse
  OpenSanctions (optional)        CC BY-NC 4.0 — NON-COMMERCIAL ONLY

Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence
v3.0.
